41:39.670 --> 41:40.820
Bilakah dia pergi?

41:40.960 --> 41:42.360
Dia dah pergi malam tadi.

41:42.630 --> 41:44.630
Dia seolah-olahnya datang ke Guangping untuk uruskan hal.

41:44.630 --> 41:46.030
Dia cakap urusan itu dah selesai,

41:46.030 --> 41:46.830
